[ti:Day 28]

[00:00.00]donation 例 The donation will be the largest ever to the school by one of its graduates. 这将是迄今为止 学校收到的最大一笔毕业生个人捐款。
[00:09.98]intermediary 例 Through an intermediary, I contacted the engineer of the IT Department. 通过一位中间 人，我联系上了IT部门的这位工程师。
[00:20.39]deflation 例 The central bank determined to undertake unlimited policies to fight against the country's existing deflation. 中央银行决定采取 无限制政策来应对本国现有的通货紧缩现象。
[00:35.30]automaker 例 Some of its operations could be taken over by another automaker or it could even be forced to liquidate. 它的一些业务可能由另一家 汽车制造商来接手，甚至可能被迫进行清算。
[00:48.80]deem 例 The government may seek to block rate increases that exceed the amount they deem acceptable. 如果汇率增长超出了政府可接受的数 值，他们可能会出面阻止。
[01:00.48]leap 例 His success beneflts from him leaping at an opportunity. 他的成功得益于一次机会带给他的 转变。
[01:07.93]malfeasance 例 Several cases of malfeasance in the flnancial world are currently being investigated. 好几个金融界的渎职案件目前正处 于调查阶段。
[01:20.03]distort 例 Floods of shares came into the secondary market, as a consequence, it distorted the price formation mechanism. 大量股票涌入二级 市场，扭曲了股票价格形成机制。
[01:34.38]merit 例 If your ideas have merit, sooner or later the leader will see your talent. 如果你的想法有价 值，领导迟早会看到你的能力。
[01:43.80]alleviate 例 Several measures have been adopted to alleviate the company's flscal woes. 已经采取 了一些措施来减轻公司的财政负担。
[01:54.21]articulate 例 With unity Europe was bound to articulate its own identity. 实现了联合，欧洲必然要清楚地 表明自己的同一性。
[02:02.79]address 例 The reform efforts conducted by the banks failed to address the basic problem of the financial crisis. 银行实行的改革并没有解决这次 金融危机的根本问题。
[02:16.01]scatter 例 The Chinese companies with ample cash to scatter in their various overseas takeover bids should also make efforts to build a good image overseas. 那些将大量资金分散投资到海 外收购中的中国公司也应该努力营造出好的海外
[02:34.30]lease 例 Please send your certificates along with the lease after you've confirmed all the information. 请在确认过所有信息之后，把你的 证书和租约寄给我。
[02:46.54]edge 例 Our company has a slight edge in the trade finance services. 我们公司在贸易融资服务行业 中略占优势。
[02:54.27]cater 例 One of the store's strengths is its ability to cater to all segments of the population by adapting products and prices. 这家商店的一项 长处便是以不同的产品和价格组合迎合不同层次 的人们。
[03:09.04]financial 例 It is vitally important to have a strict flnancial management for a company. 对一个 公司来说，严格的财务管理是至关重要的。
[03:19.45]prolong 例 The contract was prolonged for another two years. 合同延期了两年。
[03:26.48]disproportionate 例 The lack of core technology aggravated the disproportionate development in this country. 核心技术的缺乏加剧了该国的不均衡发展。
[03:39.71]evict 例 The tenant had been evicted for not paying the rent. 那名租户曾因未付房租被撵了出去。
[03:46.60]hike 例 The government should look at a range of options, including a hike in electricity charges and longer holidays. 政府应该考虑采取一些措 施，包括提高电价、延长公共假期等。
[04:00.38]expire 例 The acceptance draft will expire in 90 days. 这张承兑汇票90天后到期。
[04:06.57]amplify 例 Unlike consumption of material goods, spending on leisure and services typically strengthens social bonds, which in turn helps to amplify happiness. 与物质消费不同，休闲和 服务型消费明显地会增强社会联系，反过来有助 于增强幸福感。
[04:25.70]deduct 例 The new decree orders employers to deduct taxes from employees' salary. 新法令要 求雇主从员工的薪金中扣税。
[04:35.26]gratify 例 Mr. Dambar was gratifled by his response. 他的答复让丹巴尔先生感到很满意。
[04:41.31]dissuade 例 The new policy will dissuade foreign capital from investing in ventures that cause serious pollution. 新政策将阻止外国资本投资严重污染环 境的企业。
[04:54.82]vogue 例 Long hair for men has been in vogue in many cities for many years. 男士留长发在许多 城市里流行好多年了。
[05:03.11]electronics 例 The future of the electronics industry is very promising. 电子工业的发展前景十分乐观。
[05:11.69]conduct 例 One of the most important things you can do as a manager is to conduct accurate and timely performance evaluations of your employees. 作为经理，最重要的职责之一就是对 你的雇员进行准确和及时的绩效评估。
[05:28.43]flexitime 例 He refused to go along with popular management trends such as flexitime and teleworking. 他拒绝跟随大众化的管理潮流，如 实行弹性上班制和远程办公。
[05:40.39]frontier 例 The people of that frontier state are famous for not believing anything people tell them. 这个边境州的人们以不相信别人告诉他们 的任何事情而著名。
[05:52.20]grade 例 Students will be interviewed by a foreign lecturer who will grade their English level and decide the most appropriate class for them. 外 教将对学生进行面试，将他们的英语水平划分等 级，从而确定最适合他们的班级。
[06:08.80]anecdote 例 For Roberts, the anecdote amounted to a parable on the pitfalls of economic forecasting. 对于罗伯茨而言，这则轶事是对经 济难以预测的一种比喻。 time sheet/card 工作时间记录表；考勤卡
