[06:31.31]breed 例 The new breed of a nimal is under observation. 新的动物品种正在观察中。
[06:37.50]binder 例 This flling cabinet is large, so you can create a view for each binder. 这个文件柜很 大，你可以为每个活页夹创建一个视图。
[06:46.64]casting 例 There must be at least hundreds of statues. I really marvel at the beautiful artistic design and exquisite casting skills. 雕像至少有数百 个。我对这么精美的艺术设计及精湛的铸造技艺 感到非常惊讶。
[07:02.25]bottleneck 例 China has to transform its economic growth model to break through the bottleneck for development. 中国需要通过转变经济增长方 式来突破发展瓶颈。
[07:15.47]commute 例 The fear has led some doctors who live in the city to commute to hospitals far outside New Orleans rather than work locally. 这种担心 促使一些本地的医生宁愿每天坐车到远离新奥尔 良的医院上班也不愿在当地工作。
