[07:40.37]awkward 例 Global equity is the awkward issue lying behind the world food crisis. 在世界粮食危机的 背后是全球公平性的棘手议题。
[07:49.79]consequence 例 This is viewed as a consequence of our inability to understand and treat a complex problem. 人们把这看成是我们不能很好地理解和 处理复杂问题的结果。
[08:02.17]husbandry 例 Through careful husbandry we survived the hard winter of the business. 通过妥善的管理， 我们终于熬过了企业的寒冬。
[08:12.02]empire 例 This famous director said the fact that MGM had failed was because it tried to build a movie empire based on fllm production. 这位 著名导演表示，米高梅电影公司之所以经营失 败，原因就在于它试图以影片制作为基础，建立 一个电影帝国。
