[08:37.90]avoid 例 The present strength in the stock market does not necessarily mean that the economy will avoid recession. 股市现在的强势发展并不意 味着可以避开经济萧条。
[08:51.26]convey 例 When it comes to marketing your product, everything from packaging to mailing materials should convey a message about your business. 当你的产品准备上市时，从包装 到邮寄资料等一切行为都应该传达出关于你的业 务的信息。
[09:08.14]high-flyer 例 If you're a high-flyer, that might be the route for you. 如果你是一个有野心的人，那可能 是一条属于你的路。
